{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104772","id":2427133151,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Qqxzf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104772","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104772.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104772.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104772","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104772/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104772/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104772/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3c27aa6bcd3ec5aa287fe62f545e3297493d1bcc","number":104772,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Handle null values for object types, as seen in typed dictionaries","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes typed dictionaries not providing an editable property in the inspector for `null` values, as described in #104760.\r\n\r\nTo do this it adds a check in `EditorInspectorDefaultPlugin::get_editor_for_property` to see if the value for `p_hint` is `PROPERTY_HINT_RESOURCE_TYPE` or `PROPERTY_HINT_NODE_TYPE` when `p_type` is `Variant::NIL`. If it is, then the case instead returns the result for the function as if it was called with `Variant::OBJECT`. It was done this way to avoid changing `p_type` to not be const and to not introduce another variable, since I assumed almost all arguments being const was for performance reasons. Happy to introduce a second variable or make `p_type` not const if that is preferred.\r\n\r\nOriginal experience (from issue):\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66705de8-33ef-4d9b-bfc4-aabf1f9aa308)\r\n\r\nResulting experience:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2025-03-29 17-56-47](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4d402e4-7efa-42a7-9533-640fe739b733)\r\n\r\nFixes #104760\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url"